{
  "id": "329",
  "title": "Who Do You Choose?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-05-27",
  "synopsis": "The wife asks the husband if he wants to take out an older woman or a younger woman.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/429/9cf418ea51536176ea8daf69b67661c9beadf7c3.mp3?1495475450",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你选谁？\n\n    星期六的早上，老婆问：“亲爱的，有两个女的，一个老一些，一个小一些。你可以选一个带出去玩，你选哪一个？”\n    老公问：“要是我说真话，你会不会生气？”\n    老婆说：“不会不会。”\n    老公说：“那我选小的。”\n    老婆笑了，说：“那好。你带女儿出去玩吧，我去逛街了。”",
    "traditional": "你選誰？\n\n    星期六的早上，老婆問：“親愛的，有兩個女的，一個老一些，一個小一些。你可以選一個帶出去玩，你選哪一個？”\n    老公問：“要是我說真話，你會不會生氣？”\n    老婆說：“不會不會。”\n    老公說：“那我選小的。”\n    老婆笑了，說：“那好。你帶女兒出去玩吧，我去逛街了。”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Who Do You Choose?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "星期六的早上，老婆问：",
      "traditional": "星期六的早上，老婆問：",
      "pinyin": "xīng qī liù de zǎo shang lǎo po wèn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "“亲爱的，有两个女的，一个老一些，一个小一些。",
      "traditional": "“親愛的，有兩個女的，一個老一些，一個小一些。",
      "pinyin": "qīn ài de yǒu liǎng ge nǚ de yí ge lǎo yì xiē yí ge xiǎo yì xiē",
      "english": "Saturday morning, the wife asks:"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "你可以选一个带出去玩，你选哪一个？”",
      "traditional": "你可以選一個帶出去玩，你選哪一個？”",
      "pinyin": "nǐ kě yǐ xuǎn yí ge dài chū qù wán nǐ xuǎn nǎ yí ge",
      "english": "“Darling, there are two women, one a bit older and one a bit younger.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“You can choose one of them to take out for some fun. Which do you choose?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "老公问：“要是我说真话，你会不会生气？”",
      "traditional": "老公問：“要是我說真話，你會不會生氣？”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo gōng wèn yào shi wǒ shuō zhēn huà nǐ huì bú huì shēng qì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The husband asks: “If I say the truth, will you be angry?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "老婆说：“不会不会。”",
      "traditional": "老婆說：“不會不會。”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo po shuō bú huì bú huì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The wife says: “No no.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "老公说：“那我选小的。”",
      "traditional": "老公說：“那我選小的。”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo gōng shuō nà wǒ xuǎn xiǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The husband says: “Then I choose the younger one.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "老婆笑了，说：“那好。你带女儿出去玩吧，我去逛街了。”",
      "traditional": "老婆笑了，說：“那好。你帶女兒出去玩吧，我去逛街了。”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo po xiào le shuō nà hǎo nǐ dài nǚ ér chū qù wán ba wǒ qù guàng jiē le",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
